<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: electronic jammer station -->
  <DMSE_JammerStation.label>電子干擾機</DMSE_JammerStation.label>
  <!-- EN: A high-power ground jammer. While transmitting it projects a red ring on the world map, 8 tiles around this colony's tile. A hostile missile entering the ring is rolled once: its seeker may be knocked out, and it then either vanishes off-map or falls on inertial guidance alone. Anti-radiation and inertial missiles are immune. Enemy radars inside the ring also lose range and lock speed.\n\nComms consoles on this map stop working while it transmits, with no exceptions. It draws 6000 W at full power and 600 W on standby, fails at once when the power fails, and anti-radiation missiles home on it. -->
  <DMSE_JammerStation.description>大功率地面干擾站。發射時會在世界地圖上以本殖民地為中心畫出半徑 8 格的紅圈。敵對導彈進圈時擲骰一次：導引頭可能被打掉，之後不是在地圖外消失，就是只能靠慣性落地。反輻射與慣性導彈免疫。圈內的敵方雷達也會失去距離與鎖定速度。\n\n發射期間本圖通訊台一律停用，沒有例外。滿段耗電 6000 瓦、待機 600 瓦，斷電立刻失效，而且反輻射導彈會追著它飛。</DMSE_JammerStation.description>
  
  <!-- EN: long-range warning radar -->
  <DMSE_OTHWarningRadar.label>長程預警雷達</DMSE_OTHWarningRadar.label>
  <!-- EN: A huge over-the-horizon array that bounces signals off the ionosphere to spot incoming threats up to 40 world tiles away. Its resolution is poor: small targets shrink out of its range, and it has no fire-control channels at all. It buys decision time, not interceptions.\n\nDraws 12000 W at full power. -->
  <DMSE_OTHWarningRadar.description>利用電離層反射訊號的超視距巨型陣列，最遠可在 40 世界格外發現來襲目標。解析度很差：小型目標的有效距離會縮水，也完全沒有火控通道。它買到的是決策時間，不是攔截能力。\n\n滿段耗電 12000 瓦。</DMSE_OTHWarningRadar.description>
  
  <!-- EN: war room console -->
  <DMSE_WarRoomConsole.label>戰情終端</DMSE_WarRoomConsole.label>
  <!-- EN: A command console for this map's air defense. It sets rules of engagement for both local and world-map interception, and remotely switches and throttles every radar and jammer on the map, including one-touch emissions silence. None of that needs a crew.\n\nAn operator adds a skill bonus while seated: Intellectual extends radar search range, Shooting shortens missile launcher cooldown. Operators at several consoles add their skill levels together, up to a total of 40.\n\nThe rules only apply while a console stands on the map. -->
  <DMSE_WarRoomConsole.description>本圖防空的指揮台。可為地圖層與世界層的攔截設定交戰限制，並遙控全圖雷達與干擾機的開關與功率，包含一鍵電磁靜默。這些都不需要有人站崗。\n\n有操作員坐鎮時另有技能加成：智識延長雷達搜索距離，射擊縮短導彈發射平台的冷卻。多座終端的操作員等級會疊加，合計上限 40。\n\n交戰限制只在本圖有戰情終端時生效。</DMSE_WarRoomConsole.description>
  
</LanguageData>